  "label": "Sarcastic Rebranding",
  "description": "Sarcastic rebranding is a rhetorical technique where a serious or controversial topic is humorously or ironically reinterpreted as something trivial, commercial, or entertainment-oriented. In this meme, the gun range is sarcastically rebranded as a '2nd amendment theme park,' which is a form of satirical commentary on the normalization or commercialization of gun culture.",
